					{
						"description": "DAMAGED24.39\nThis ability always takes the form Damaged X. While a model's remaining wounds are equal to or less than X, that model is damaged: while damaged, that model's attacks have -1 to hit rolls.",
						"name": "Damaged: 1-6 Wounds Remaining",
