			"meta": {
				"abilities": [
					{
						"description": "At the start of your Command phase, you can select one combat doctrine listed below. If you do, that combat doctrine is active for friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES units with this ability until the start of your next Command phase.\nASSAULT DOCTRINEWhen this unit is selected to make an advance move, that advance move does not prevent this unit from being eligible to declare a charge.\nDEVASTATOR DOCTRINEThis unit's ranged attacks have [ASSAULT].\nTACTICAL DOCTRINEWhen this unit is selected to make a fall-back move, that fall-back move does not prevent this unit from being eligible to shoot and eligible to declare a charge.\nUnless otherwise stated:\n• You can only select each combat doctrine once per battle.\n• Only one combat doctrine can be active for each unit. If a rule makes a combat doctrine active for a unit, any combat doctrine previously active for that unit is no longer active for that unit.",
						"name": "Combat Doctrines",
						"type": "Faction"
					},
					{
						"description": "The unit has the Deep Strike ability.",
						"name": "Deep Strike",
						"type": "Core"
					},
					{
						"description": "At the start of the battle, you can set up one Teleport Homer token for this unit on the battlefield. If you do:\n• When you target this unit with the Rapid Ingress stratagem, you can use that Teleport Homer token. If you do, that use is -1 CP, but when resolving that stratagem, this unit must be set up within 3\" of that Teleport Homer token and not within 8\" of an enemy unit. That Teleport Homer token is then removed from the battlefield.\n• If an enemy unit ends a move within 1\" of that Teleport Homer token, that Teleport Homer token is removed from the battlefield.",
						"name": "Teleport Homer",
						"type": "Datasheet"
					},
					{
						"description": "If this unit made a charge move this turn, this unit's:\n• Lightning Claws weapons have [Sustained Hits 1: non-Monster/Vehicle].\n• Thunder Hammer weapons have [Sustained Hits 1: Monster/Vehicle].",
						"name": "Terminatus Assault",
						"type": "Datasheet"
					},
					{
						"description": "This model has +1 W.",
						"name": "Storm Shield",
						"type": "Wargear"
					}
